<title>JAPAN: &quot;Virtual pet&quot; drives Bandai shares up in morning.</title>
<headline>&quot;Virtual pet&quot; drives Bandai shares up in morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bandai Co Ltd jumped in early Thursday morning Tokyo trade, driven by the &quot;virtual pet&quot; fad, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0051 GMT, the toy maker's shares were up 180 yen at 2,540 yen, the fourth-largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
